      "title": "metrics.md",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "chunk_id": "f7c9de55-811f-59f0-b88b-561bc71a193b",
      "text_content": "e counts describe the sample only and do not establish a cause for the change.\n\n## Metric definition\n\nA processed request is a request marked complete within the sample reporting period. Reopened requests are counted once, at their final completion. Both sample periods use this same definition. No customer names, credentials, private support tickets or real company identifiers are included in this fixture.\n\n",
