      "chunk_id": "e1d2be5f-a79b-5e9f-8c14-dd562f14a5e8",
      "text_content": "vate support tickets or real company identifiers are included in this fixture.\n\n## Data quality\n\nThe source deliberately does not contain a causal explanation. Future analytics should distinguish supplied facts from hypotheses. These sentences also make the fixture long enough to exercise a bounded chunk with an overlap while retaining paragraph locations.\n",
